What is a HIFI Headphone?
HIFI headphones are premium grade audio devices engineered to deliver neutral sound signatures, exceptionally low distortion, and an extended frequency response. They achieve reference level fidelity through advanced driver technologies such as planar magnetic, electrostatic, and high efficiency dynamic drivers. These headphones are favoured by audiophiles who demand accurate imaging, as well as professional engineers who rely on neutral tuning for critical mixing and mastering tasks.
